  ((select id from entities where slug = 'jim-beam'), (select id from entities where slug = 'suntory-global-spirits'), 'https://www.suntoryglobalspirits.com/brands', 'Page « Our Corporate Brands » (nos marques) du site officiel de Suntory Global Spirits, en anglais (« We deliver the highest quality spirits through a broad portfolio of beloved brands ») : « Jim Beam® Since 1795, seven generations of one family have crafted the world-renowned Jim Beam. Visit Jim Beam Maker’s Mark® The benchmark for elevated, flavorful bourbon since 1958. Visit Maker’s Mark House of Suntory Refined artistry to carefully craft spirits that reflect the Nature and Spirit of Japan. VISIT WEBSITE Whiskey Tequila RTD Vodka Gin All brands Whiskey With deep heritage and a drive to introduce pioneering new tastes, our whiskeys include Bourbon, Japanese, Scotch, Irish and Canadian. Discover Whiskey Brands close Tequila Authenticity and craftsmanship combine for a rich portfolio of tequila brands. Discover Tequila brands close Ready-To-Drink Our Ready-To-Drink brands offer premium spirits and breakthrough innovation. Discover Ready-To-Drink brands close Vodka Our vodka brands include the art of Japanese craftsmanship and distinct character. Discover Vodka brands close Gin Our collection of gins are crafted with the finest ingredients to create a winning range of spirits. Discover Gin brands close Visit the Jim Beam® distillery Walk the hallowed grounds of whiskey history in the footsteps of the First Family of Bourbon. Join us for a day in Kentucky that’s two centuries in the making. Visit Jim Beam Your browser does not support the video tag. Visit the Maker’s Mark® distillery Maker''s Mark is proud to be the largest distillery in the world – and the first in Bourbon Country® – to join the B Corp™ global community. Visit Maker''s Mark Visit the Hakushu® distillery Refinement and artistry come together to produce this pioneer of Japanese whisky. Visit the distillery to see how it all comes together. Visit Hakushu All brands Iconic and innovative. We deliver the highest quality spirits through a broad portfolio of beloved brands. CORDIALS & LIQUEURS Sourz® Sourz® is a great-tasting shot, famous for its distinct sweet and sour fruit flavor. This unique treat has captured a respectable share of the market in countries including the U.K. and Sweden. »', '2026-10-13', 'delegue-editeur:verifie-mot-pour-mot', '2026-10-15', 'confirmee', 'citation retrouvée mot pour mot'),
